  "description": "BarcodeLib Barcode for WinForms C# library allows you to create, print QR Code, Code 128 and other 2d, 1d barcodes in the Windows Forms, WPF, console desktop .NET Framework (4.x, 3.x, 2.x) applications.\n\nSupported barcode formats :\n* QR Code (Steyled QR Code, GS1 version), Data Matrix (GS1 version), PDF-417\n* Code 39, Code 128, GS1-128\n* EAN 8, EAN 13, UPC-A, UPC-E, +2, +5 supplemental codes\n* Interleaved 2 of 5, ITF-14\n* And other barcodes\n\nOutput :\n* Raster images: bitmap (.bmp), gif, png, jpeg/jpg, tiff\n* Vector images: svg, eps\n* Stream objects or binary data\n\nCompatible with :\n* .NET Framework 4.x, 3.x, and 2.x\n\nFor .NET Core version nuget package, do search \"BarcodeLib.Barcode.Common\"\n\nOnline Documents\n* C# How to Guide : https://www.barcodelib.com/csharp/\n* Licenses : https://www.barcodelib.com/purchase/license-barcode-net.html\n* Email : support@barcodelib.com",
